{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\">中華人民共和國成立77周年，特區政府及多個中央駐港機構舉行升旗儀式。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">國慶升旗儀式在灣仔金紫荊廣場舉行，由警察樂隊奏樂開路，緊隨有多支紀律部隊以中式步操進場。行政長官李家超與夫人進場時檢閱出席的青少年制服團隊。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\"><br/> <div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\"><br/> <img alt=\"Picture_J.FLAG 1200.jpg\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026U2PXTip8wJ1790831612.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"Picture_J.FLAG 1200.jpg\"/><br/> </div><br/></div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">升旗儀式在早上八時舉行，現場奏唱國歌和行注目禮。出席的還包括全國政協副主席梁振英、中聯辦主任周霽、前行政長官曾蔭權和林鄭月娥及多名政府官員等。政府飛行服務隊直升機，消防滅火輪，分別在空中和海上致意。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\"><br/> <div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\"><br/> <img alt=\"Picture_J.FLAG 1200_001.jpg\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026fnEij0kAP71790831646.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"Picture_J.FLAG 1200_001.jpg\"/><br/> </div><br/></div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">中聯辦亦在早上約七時，在辦公大樓前舉行升旗儀式，由主任周霽率領一眾人員出席，肅立並向國旗行注目禮。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\"><br/> <div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\"><br/> <img alt=\"Picture_J.FLAG 1200_003.jpg\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026GsFdyRIPlo1790831671.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"Picture_J.FLAG 1200_003.jpg\"/><br/> </div><br/></div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">外交部駐港特派員公署亦舉行升旗禮，駐港特派員崔建春與工作人員出席，現場奏唱國歌。<br/></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">駐港國安公署亦在臨時辦公大樓升旗，署長董經緯及警方代表出席。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">駐港解放軍亦進行升旗儀式，其中在中環軍營，升旗隊步出中區軍用碼頭升旗。昂船洲、石崗等多個軍營均有升旗儀式。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\"><br/> <div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\"><br/> <img alt=\"Picture_J.FLAG 1200_006.jpg\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026XYmtiyj4ft1790831569.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"Picture_J.FLAG 1200_006.jpg\"/><br/> </div><br/></div></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-01T05:58:20.328730+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":381,"images":4,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}